      <h2>GMT to HDT Time Difference</h2>
      <p>
        The precise time difference between Greenwich Mean Time and Hawaii-Aleutian Daylight Time is <strong>9 hours</strong>. Hawaii-Aleutian Daylight Time is permanently 9 hours behind Greenwich Mean Time.
      </p>
      <p>
        The conversion mathematical equation is expressed as:
      </p>
      <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; margin: 1.5rem 0;">
