      <ul style="padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.9;">
        <li><strong>GMT 00:00 to 08:59:</strong> Results in HDT 15:00 to 23:59 on the <strong>PREVIOUS calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 09:00:</strong> Results in HDT 00:00 (midnight) at the start of the <strong>SAME calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 12:00:</strong> Results in HDT 03:00 AM on the <strong>SAME calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 21:00:</strong> Results in HDT 12:00 PM (noon) on the <strong>SAME calendar date</strong>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
